{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu064-e-r-reward-dispatch","title":"孙权遣薛综劳军","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-adc177eee10994fdd311","label":"正文","text":"权嘉其功遣薛综劳军；综先移恪等备述山越平荡献戎十万、功轶古人","evidence":["santizhu064-q-3ab3d71f300f5a2a19bb","santizhu064-q-78f04d941769006b37d6"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"遣薛综劳军","evidence":["santizhu064-q-3ab3d71f300f5a2a19bb"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0071","role":"奉遣劳军","evidence":["santizhu064-q-3ab3d71f300f5a2a19bb"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"受薛综移书犒劳者","evidence":["santizhu064-q-3ab3d71f300f5a2a19bb","santizhu064-q-78f04d941769006b37d6"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文纪年保留于引文；无审定公元年，不换算或推算。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-3ab3d71f300f5a2a19bb","santizhu064-q-78f04d941769006b37d6"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-3ab3d71f300f5a2a19bb","source_order":[64,37,0],"order":10939}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0041","name":"诸葛恪","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0071","name":"薛综","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-3ab3d71f300f5a2a19bb","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-3c739de8666ef6161536","layer":"original","quote":"权嘉其功，遣尚书仆射薛综劳军。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-78f04d941769006b37d6","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-3c739de8666ef6161536","layer":"original","quote":"综先移恪等曰〖26〗：“山越恃阻，不宾历世〖27〗；缓则首鼠〖28〗，急则狼顾〖29〗。皇帝赫然，命将西征；神策内授，武师外震。兵不染锷〖30〗，甲不沾汗；元恶既枭，种党归义〖31〗；荡涤山薮，献戎十万〖32〗。野无遗寇，邑罔残奸；既扫凶慝〖33〗，又充军用。藜稂莠〖34〗，化为善草；魑魅魍魉〖35〗，更成虎士〖36〗。虽实国家威灵之所加，亦信元帅临履之所致也〖37〗。虽《诗》美执讯〖38〗，《易》嘉折首〖39〗；周之方、召〖40〗，汉之卫、霍〖41〗：岂足以谈？功轶古人〖42〗，勋超前世。主上欢然，遥用叹息。感《四牡》之遗典〖43〗，思饮至之旧章〖44〗；故遣中台近官〖45〗，迎致犒赐：以旌茂功，以慰劬劳〖46〗。”","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":328,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
